<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-26T20:40:34.465Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:40:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran special forces and 450 troops have been sent to Haiti to search for four missing Salvadoran soldiers and four kidnapped aviation technicians after a gang ambush, while President Bukele says recovered remains are not those personnel. Haitian gangs continue targeted attacks, forcing civilians to flee the communes of Petite Rivière de l'Artibonite and Arcahaie. The Dominican Republic has reinforced its southern frontier and border with Haiti amid the security crisis, while press freedom in Haiti is reported as critical. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPN3N0enNCa0pOSjQzZ0ZLcmJtZEdvY0JFNl95NkRWSkZOUGkwb0FLTmRCOWRGVEthTE1OZ0NHbjZkOUNMRFA3LU8tR1NSUVFwRVYybVl4N28ydjRGVU9sWUFWdF8xZE0zZzRwekE4UHpURnFLZjNmVnRCNURtOFhaOTh2bmQtcEN1MXdnS05HYVg3OVNQVDVVOFVUclVFMzQ0N1h0dnVydmsyT2hBNFY2bzFkd0xfNElWWGc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swOEcxQnZYQW9uLXVxWURpUkUxdGhwOXhsSXNWd0g2NGdzd2FmQVY2Wk5YcjZtSS1TWXVvNEJ4N2NmMGN4M21RS2E1UlJ3NFBCMlAzcVJxWGxOdDcyRXE3MHluMzJ5ZHhGblNaV3RTSVVLYUpkb2xRdHZJUFVmNW1mQlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPNEhheFZNZ2tfQ1lLWUNHT0c3T29aZ2J1LVhBSmJUczIxNGhSTzFOOUt6M1lPQnZSTnVjaUljQ2w5Rk80UUJ0cndvVzg4ZlJhLU0yUHdNVk9kZld4d2RlbC1WblBPSVRyajlmV1dlMmVXclRxQUZtV2l2ZGluTGhHRDlhNmt2dEx0cW9yd1dB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOcnBPZi0xWUx0c3FBazlGeWNNRkxFcFFRanl4SjFvVHJGZDNxelVEdldMbjhqQUNVX0tfNmFmRU5CZUtBaEQyam15c3IwRlNONTVPbGpHclUyelE0dWtnNjF4bHJCT3YyZmFCazJFOHhOYVFsUDFkeEV2UGlHQk1SaHExTEE2TXdxQ25ndXhrRy1MSkwxcEMyX3R3?oc=5&quot;&